      "writtenOn": "2017-07-25T21:37:37Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The purpose of flat_srcs is that eg. under Python standard lib there are some platform based sub-folders containing .py files, eg. Lib/plat-linux2/*.py, Lib/plat-mac/*.py, and etc. When we build Python par file for linux, we have to extract files under Lib/plat-linux2 to Lib/ level in order for Python run-time access. So during packaging phase, we have to mark which files we need to lift up.",
